#: ../../source/docs/terrain-following-manual-modes.rst:5
#: 37eec593aac1405ea2776584f4b6ecec
msgid "Surface Tracking"
msgstr "地表跟踪"

#: ../../source/docs/terrain-following-manual-modes.rst:7
#: 2f14260333394b74a21866bb48493cab
msgid ""
"Copter supports low altitude Surface Tracking, either a floor/ground or a "
"ceiling, in nearly all modes including pilot controlled modes like "
":ref:`AltHold <altholdmode>`, :ref:`Loiter <loiter-mode>` and :ref:`PosHold "
"<poshold-mode>`."
msgstr ""
"Copter 支持低空地表跟踪，可跟踪地面/地板或天花板，在几乎所有模式下均可使用，包括飞手控制模式如 :ref:`AltHold "
"<altholdmode>`、:ref:`Loiter <loiter-mode>` 和 :ref:`PosHold <poshold-mode>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/terrain-following-manual-modes.rst:9
#: d37c4b6841aa4736b3555e35b6880974
msgid ""
"Additionally, :ref:`Terrain Following<terrain-following>` is supported in "
"autonomous modes using a terrain height data base stored on the autopilot's "
"SD card and/or obtained real-time from the Ground Control Station."
msgstr ""
"此外，自主模式下还支持 :ref:`地形跟随<terrain-following>`，使用存储在飞控 SD 卡上和/或从地面站实时获取的地形高度数据库。"

#: ../../source/docs/terrain-following-manual-modes.rst:11
#: da871d1bc4a644ca98bde579116d910c
msgid ""
"This page describes the Surface Following setup .  For autonomous modes "
"using downloaded data for Terrain Following please see the :ref:`terrain "
"following for autonomous modes <terrain-following>` wiki page."
msgstr ""
"本页介绍地表跟踪的设置。有关使用下载数据在自主模式下进行地形跟随的内容，请参阅 :ref:`自主模式地形跟随 <terrain-following>` "
"Wiki 页面。"

#: ../../source/docs/terrain-following-manual-modes.rst:17
#: 3136d645ae7549d39f9a42eeb844c5c7
msgid "Setup and Configuration"
msgstr "设置与配置"

#: ../../source/docs/terrain-following-manual-modes.rst:19
#: e10eb36423ee42b69d2d3817d1c81907
msgid ""
"Connect a downward facing rangefinder(for floor/ground tracking) and/or an "
"upward facing rangefinder (for ceiling tracking) :ref:`lidar or sonar "
"<common-rangefinder-landingpage>` to the vehicle."
msgstr ""
"将朝下的测距仪（用于地面/地板跟踪）和/或朝上的测距仪（用于天花板跟踪）:ref:`激光雷达或声纳 <common-rangefinder-"
"landingpage>` 连接到飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/terrain-following-manual-modes.rst:21
#: dda0ff3566164091a5de91e95ee77337
msgid ""
"Which is being used is configured by the :ref:`SURFTRAK_MODE<SURFTRAK_MODE>`"
" parameter or by:"
msgstr "使用哪个测距仪通过 :ref:`SURFTRAK_MODE<SURFTRAK_MODE>` 参数或以下方式配置："

#: ../../source/docs/terrain-following-manual-modes.rst:22
#: 31f369fc4cbb45e89ee21098909538ce
msgid ""
"An :ref:`auxiliary switch <common-auxiliary-functions>` (function \"75\"), "
"or  :ref:`channel-7-and-8-options`, can be configured to turn on/off use of "
"the rangefinder."
msgstr ""
"可以配置 :ref:`辅助开关 <common-auxiliary-functions>`（功能\"75\"）或 "
":ref:`channel-7-and-8-options` 来开/关测距仪的使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/terrain-following-manual-modes.rst:23
#: 28014b30d05e487a86a8023ee6dfcb53
msgid ""
"the :ref:`SURFTRAK_TC<SURFTRAK_TC>` parameter controls the smoothing of the "
"surface data. Increase if you are moving fast and getting perturbations in "
"the flight path. Conversely, it can be lower to make the vehicle more "
"responsive to the rangefinder data."
msgstr ""
":ref:`SURFTRAK_TC<SURFTRAK_TC>` "
"参数控制地表数据的平滑程度。如果飞行速度较快且飞行路径出现扰动，请增大此值。反之，可以减小此值以使飞行器对测距仪数据的响应更灵敏。"

#: ../../source/docs/terrain-following-manual-modes.rst:27
#: 0d13ab1e777848bba7908d1d8fa17ff9
msgid ""
"Do not set the :ref:`EK3_SRC1_POSZ <EK3_SRC1_POSZ>` to Rangefinder.  This "
"parameter should be left at the default."
msgstr "不要将 :ref:`EK3_SRC1_POSZ <EK3_SRC1_POSZ>` 设置为测距仪。此参数应保持默认值。"

#: ../../source/docs/terrain-following-manual-modes.rst:29
#: 5b3f9525f6fc4b3192ff862f62d039f1
msgid ""
"Do not set :ref:`EK3_RNG_USE_HGT <EK3_RNG_USE_HGT>` parameter.  This "
"parameter should be left at \"-1\"."
msgstr "不要设置 :ref:`EK3_RNG_USE_HGT <EK3_RNG_USE_HGT>` 参数。此参数应保持为\"-1\"。"

#: ../../source/docs/terrain-following-manual-modes.rst:32
#: a676d751beeb479495cee5085a2e7d18
msgid "How does it work?"
msgstr "工作原理？"

#: ../../source/docs/terrain-following-manual-modes.rst:34
#: e446e78e41cb47b880fced45866b9693
msgid ""
"When the rangefinder can \"see\" the ground, the pilot's throttle stick "
"adjusts the target altitude above the ground (i.e. the attitude corrected "
"distance from the range finder)"
msgstr "当测距仪能够\"看到\"地面时，飞手的油门摇杆调整离地目标高度（即经姿态修正的测距仪距离）"

#: ../../source/docs/terrain-following-manual-modes.rst:35
#: 6a25fb6803194168bc951a8c260063c0
msgid ""
"When the vehicle climbs out of the rangefinder's range the pilot's stick "
"returns to directly controlling the vehicle's target climb rate (i.e. EKF "
"estimated climb rate based on barometer and accelerometer).  When the "
"vehicle comes back within the range of the ground, the target altitude above"
" the terrain is reset to the current altitude above terrain. For more "
"information, see :ref:`Understanding Altitude in ArduPilot <common-"
"understanding-altitude>`."
msgstr ""
"当飞行器爬升超出测距仪量程时，飞手摇杆将直接控制飞行器的目标爬升速率（即基于气压计和加速度计的 EKF "
"估计爬升速率）。当飞行器重新回到地面测距范围内时，目标地形高度将重置为当前离地高度。更多信息请参见 :ref:`了解 ArduPilot 中的高度 "
"<common-understanding-altitude>`。"
